  "document": "Lynn Ahrens\nLynn Ahrens (born October 1, 1948) is an American writer and lyricist for the musical theatre, television and film. She has collaborated with Stephen Flaherty for many years. She won the Tony Award, Drama Desk Award, and Outer Critics Circle Award for the Broadway musical \"Ragtime\". Together with Flaherty, they have written many musicals, including \"Lucky Stiff\", \"Once on This Island\", \"My Favorite Year\", \"Ragtime\", \"Seussical\", \"A Man of No Importance\", \"Dessa Rose\", \"The Glorious Ones\", and most recently seen on Broadway, \"Rocky the Musical\"."
